{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever found an amazing weapon, upgrade, or level in a roguelite... only for it to be lost forever? In Erebos Loop, randomness can be controlled. Record the coordinates of anything you discover and re-access it later through Override Terminals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your perfect run and break out of the Loop in a</strong>\u00a0<strong>roguelite experience shaped by your knowledge and your actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erebos Loop</strong> is a challenging, fast-paced, retro sci-fi roguelite shooter that won't hold your hand. In Erebos, progress and survival depend solely on your skill and your ability to observe, adapt, and uncover the hidden rules of the Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a thriving network connecting star systems and galaxies, Erebos was devastated by the Hostiles, whose quantum interference shattered its fabric. Now, both humans and Hostiles are trapped within the Loop. As an Operative of the Erebos Restoration Corps, it is your mission to uncover the mysteries of the Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Erebos Loop is unpredictable in nature, but its chaos can be controlled<strong>. Every seemingly random element has underlying coordinates that you can record and reuse. Log the locations of powerful equipment, upgrades, and enemies with specific weaknesses.</strong> This knowledge becomes a strategic resource in future Loops, provided you locate valuable Override Terminals. Through observation and experimentation, you can craft your own run and forge your path through the Loop.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/2fa09c08cc927dd342322730b13e9707.avif?t=1764151783\" width=720 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50,000 procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced top-down combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of enemy, weapon, armor, and upgrade variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own run: record the coordinates behind specific encounters and equipment and use Override Terminals to shape future Loops.\u00a0Each Loop rewards observation, memory, and experimentation: every discovery will strengthen your next Loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the nature of the Erebos Loop through Expeditions and Command assignments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun your way through the Loop or try to beat your high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of symphonic metal and atmospheric sci-fi soundtracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/bd0fde1a45ccf4d54f836d6bf822c553.avif?t=1764151783\" width=720 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you break the Erebos Loop?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867660?t=1764151783","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867660?t=1764151783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/e060a8dff109e0600bb90855b9cf4a7b9c6286e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764151783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/e060a8dff109e0600bb90855b9cf4a7b9c6286e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764151783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Erebos Loop contains frequent depictions of combat and violence. Players engage in battles against non-human enemies.\r\nThere are visual effects that include blood splashes in various colors to represent alien or synthetic lifeforms, and red blood stains for the player character.\r\n\r\nThe game does not include sexual content, sexual assault, drug or alcohol use, or self-harm themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever found an amazing weapon, upgrade, or level in a roguelite... only for it to be lost forever? In Erebos Loop, randomness can be controlled. Record the coordinates of anything you discover and re-access it later through Override Terminals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your perfect run and break out of the Loop in a</strong>\u00a0<strong>roguelite experience shaped by your knowledge and your actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erebos Loop</strong> is a challenging, fast-paced, retro sci-fi roguelite shooter that won't hold your hand. In Erebos, progress and survival depend solely on your skill and your ability to observe, adapt, and uncover the hidden rules of the Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a thriving network connecting star systems and galaxies, Erebos was devastated by the Hostiles, whose quantum interference shattered its fabric. Now, both humans and Hostiles are trapped within the Loop. As an Operative of the Erebos Restoration Corps, it is your mission to uncover the mysteries of the Loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Erebos Loop is unpredictable in nature, but its chaos can be controlled<strong>. Every seemingly random element has underlying coordinates that you can record and reuse. Log the locations of powerful equipment, upgrades, and enemies with specific weaknesses.</strong> This knowledge becomes a strategic resource in future Loops, provided you locate valuable Override Terminals. Through observation and experimentation, you can craft your own run and forge your path through the Loop.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/2fa09c08cc927dd342322730b13e9707.avif?t=1764151783\" width=720 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50,000 procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced top-down combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of enemy, weapon, armor, and upgrade variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own run: record the coordinates behind specific encounters and equipment and use Override Terminals to shape future Loops.\u00a0Each Loop rewards observation, memory, and experimentation: every discovery will strengthen your next Loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the nature of the Erebos Loop through Expeditions and Command assignments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun your way through the Loop or try to beat your high scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of symphonic metal and atmospheric sci-fi soundtracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867660/extras/bd0fde1a45ccf4d54f836d6bf822c553.avif?t=1764151783\" width=720 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you break the Erebos Loop?</strong></p>","developers":["SakuSakuBake"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id